  "releaseNotes": "*\tMerge pull request #80 from matthew25187/develop\n*\tEnhance and refactor `datastandardizer-release-build-pipeline.yml` for improved flexibility and maintainability. (#79)\n*\tRefactor and enhance Azure DevOps pipeline scripts and templates. (#78)\n*\tRefactor and simplify condition handling in `datastandardizer-release-build-pipeline.yml`. (#77)\n*\tSimplify condition handling in pipeline templates. (#76)\n*\tFix syntax for variable references in `datastandardizer-ci-build-pipeline.yml`. (#75)\n*\tEnhance and refactor release build pipeline configuration (#72)\n*\tUpdate ISO 4217 currency data and tests. (#74)\n*\tRefactor and enhance Azure DevOps pipeline templates and scripts (#73)\n*\tRefactor conditional logic in CI pipeline publication stage (#71)\n*\tSimplify conditional logic in CI pipeline publication stage (#70)\n*\tRefactor condition syntax in CI pipeline (#69)\n*\tRefactor conditional logic in CI pipeline for publication stage (#68)\n*\tEnhance CI pipeline to support overriding changed package names (#67)\n*\tSimplify conditional logic in CI pipeline configuration (#66)\n*\tUpdate CI pipeline to add job dependency for version numbering (#65)\n*\tRefactor Azure DevOps pipeline and PowerShell scripts (#64)\n*\tUpdate copyright years across the solution (#62)\n*\tRefactor and enhance Azure DevOps pipeline configuration (#63)\n*\tFix: Improve handling of release notes in UpdatePackageMetadata.ps1 (#61)\n*\tRefactor: Improve .nuspec metadata validation and CI pipeline configuration (#60)\n*\tRefactor: Consolidate Base64 conversion functions and restructure build scripts (#59)\n*\tAdded version numbering job and script for CI pipeline (#58)\n*\tAdded support for retrieving ISO 3166-2 subdivision names and values (#57)\n*\tAdded support for forcing DataStandardizer.Communication package in release pipeline (#56)\n*\tAdded support for ITU-T E.164 telecommunication standards (#55)\n*\tAdded Azure Artifacts badges for additional DataStandardizer packages (#54)\n*\tRevert \"Added Azure Artifacts badges for additional DataStandardizer packages…\" (#53)\n*\tAdded Azure Artifacts badges for additional DataStandardizer packages (#52)",
